flowchart TD
    H[Researcher intent] --> C[1. Markdown contract]
    C --> R[2. YAML experiment recipe]
    R --> S[3. Session YAML + profile snapshot]
    S --> HS[4. Normal host shell]
    HS --> P[policyctl + host validation]
    HS --> A[5. Select and start primary agent adapter]

    subgraph CP[Declarative and Control Plane]
      C
      R
      S
      P
      AUD[Session audit]
      BB[Blackboard / durable case state]
      OBS[Token + session observability]
    end

    subgraph OP[Primary Agent / Multiagent Operator Plane]
      A --> PLAN[6. Discover / validate / plan]
      PLAN --> APPROVE[7. Review + human approval]
      APPROVE --> ORCH[8. Primary-agent orchestration]
      ORCH --> PL[Planner]
      ORCH --> RS[Researcher]
      ORCH --> RA[Runtime Analyst]
      ORCH --> FA[Forensics Analyst]
      ORCH --> DA[Detection Analyst]
      ORCH --> VE[Independent Verifier]
      ORCH --> RG[Report Generator]
      ORCH --> TF[Taskflow optional]
      ORCH --> LG[LangGraph optional]
      ORCH --> CR[CrewAI optional]
      ORCH --> SK[Versioned skills]
      ORCH --> MCP[Scoped MCP tools]
    end

    subgraph GP[Model / Harness Gateway Plane]
      GW[Declared routing] --> LT[LiteLLM]
      GW --> OM[OmniRoute]
    end
    R --> GW
    A --> GW

    APPROVE --> VM[9. Provision disposable Lima / QEMU]
    SEC[VM / OS security controls] --- VM

    subgraph EX[Controlled Execution Plane]
      VM --> IN[10. Start VM-side instrumentation]
      IN --> WK[11. Execute approved workload]
      WK --> COL[12. Collect telemetry + raw evidence]
    end

    COL --> BB
    BB --> ART[Evidence + hashes + provenance]
    BB --> AUD
    BB --> AN[Evidence analysis]
    AN --> VE
    VE --> RR[13. Research report]
    RG --> RR

    RR --> LEARN[14. Optional learning]
    LEARN --> EVAL[Evaluate candidate]
    EVAL --> REPLAY[Replay on preserved/distinct evidence]
    REPLAY --> VE
    VE --> HA[Human approval for promotion]
    HA --> PROM[Validated skill / recipe improvement]

    RR --> PRES[15. Preserve evidence]
    PRES --> DASH[16. Finalize tokens + dashboard]
    DASH --> DEST[17. Destroy disposable VM]
    DEST --> DONE[18. Complete session state]

    S --> AUD
    DASH --> OBS
    DONE --> OBS

    PC[policyctl<br/>outside agent control plane] -. policy decision / audit .-> APPROVE

    classDef declarative fill:#eef6ff,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:2px
    classDef agent fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ea580c,stroke-width:2px
    classDef gateway fill:#f0fdf4,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef evidence fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#7c3aed,stroke-width:2px
    classDef security fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#15803d,stroke-width:2px
    class C,R,S,P,AUD,BB,OBS declarative
    class A,PLAN,APPROVE,ORCH,PL,RS,RA,FA,DA,VE,RG,TF,LG,CR,SK,MCP agent
    class GW,LT,OM gateway
    class ART,AN,RR,LEARN,EVAL,REPLAY,HA,PROM evidence
    class VM,SEC security

    %% Invariant: agents, skills, MCP, gateways and orchestrators coordinate research; Lima/QEMU + VM/OS controls enforce workload isolation.
